### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8030/health

### List intent definitions
GET http://127.0.0.1:8030/intents

### Classify analytics/campaign question
POST http://127.0.0.1:8030/classify-intent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Which campaigns performed best?"
}

### Classify recommendation question
POST http://127.0.0.1:8030/classify-intent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Which customers should I call this week?"
}

### Orchestrate recommendation without DB context
POST http://127.0.0.1:8030/orchestrate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Which customers should I call this week?",
  "role_code": "insurance_agent",
  "include_context": false,
  "execute": false
}

### Orchestrate KPI lookup with pgvector context
POST http://127.0.0.1:8030/orchestrate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is our current lapse rate?",
  "role_code": "executive_leadership",
  "include_context": true,
  "execute": false
}

### Orchestrate explanation with pgvector context
POST http://127.0.0.1:8030/orchestrate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Why is this customer at high lapse risk?",
  "role_code": "insurance_agent",
  "entity_type": "customer",
  "include_context": true,
  "execute": false
}

